| POST | `/api/auth/login` | `{email, password}` | `{token, user: {email, role}}` |
| POST | `/api/auth/google-admin` | `{email, firebaseIdToken}` | `{token, user: {email, role}}` |
| PATCH | `/api/orders/:id/status` | `{status: "pending\|confirmed\|shipped\|delivered\|cancelled"}` | `{order: {...}}` |
| PUT | `/api/products/:id/stock` | `{stock: int}` | `{product: {...}}` |
