### Static fallback behavior

If `/api/*` requests fail (e.g. API temporarily down), the app should fall back to fetching from `/data/*.json`. Implement this in `lib/api.ts`:

```typescript
export async function getProducts(): Promise<Product[]> {
  try {
    const res = await apiGet<{products: Product[]}>('/products?limit=100');
    return res.products ?? [];
  } catch {
    const res = await fetch('/data/products.json');
    return res.json();
  }
}
```

