Visit `https://yourdomain.com/api/products?limit=5` in your browser. You should see a JSON response. If you see the React HTML instead, your `.htaccess` didn't upload correctly — re-upload it and enable hidden files in File Manager.

## Troubleshooting
- **500 Internal Server Error on /api/***: Check `api/config.php` — wrong DB credentials, or PDO MySQL extension is disabled in cPanel (extremely rare).
